<PreviewWindow id="preview-notebook" title="Field Notebook" context="entry 014 · north quay">
  <div class="min-w-0 px-[32px] py-[30px] [@media(max-width:650px)]:px-[18px] [@media(max-width:650px)]:py-[24px]">
    <header class="mb-[28px] border-b border-solai-border-subtle pb-[22px]">
      <p class="mb-[12px] mt-0 font-mono text-[11px] leading-[1.8] text-solai-text-secondary">21 OCTOBER 2026 · <time datetime="2026-10-21T20:14">20:14</time> · NORTH QUAY GLASSHOUSE</p>
      <h4 class="m-0 max-w-[560px] text-[28px] font-medium leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.035em] text-solai-text-emphasis [@media(max-width:650px)]:text-[24px]">Where the glass keeps the light</h4>
      <p class="mb-0 mt-[12px] font-mono text-[12px] text-solai-text-secondary">Evening round / planted roof → harbour wall</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid min-w-0 grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(180px,1fr)] items-start gap-[32px] [@media(max-width:650px)]:grid-cols-1 [@media(max-width:650px)]:gap-[28px]">
      <div class="min-w-0 max-w-[65ch] text-[14px] leading-[1.95] text-solai-text-primary">
        <p class="mb-[20px] mt-0">The roof has given back its last warmth. Inside the glasshouse, the bean leaves hold small reflections of the lamps, each one a folded square of amber. Outside, a ferry pulls away from North Quay. Its wake breaks the harbour lights into short, trembling lines before the water draws them straight again.</p>

        <p class="my-[20px]">I leave the west vent open a finger’s width and record the bed under <code class="rounded-[2px] bg-solai-surface-panel px-[5px] py-[2px] font-mono text-[12px] text-solai-accent-secondary">NQ-GH / 04</code>. The soil is still damp below the surface.<sup class="ml-[2px] text-[10px]"><a id="notebook-ref-1" class="text-solai-accent-primary underline decoration-solai-accent-primary underline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-solai-accent-primary" href="#notebook-note-1" aria-label="Read field note 1">1</a></sup> There is no reason to water tonight.</p>

        <blockquote class="mx-0 my-[24px] border-l-2 border-solai-accent-primary py-[3px] pl-[18px] text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-solai-text-emphasis">
          <p class="m-0">“Leave a little darkness between the lamps. The plants are not the only things that live here.”</p>
          <footer class="mt-[9px] font-mono text-[11px] text-solai-text-secondary">— chalk note beside the west door</footer>
        </blockquote>

        <p class="mb-[12px] mt-[20px]">Before locking up:</p>
        <ul class="my-0 list-disc space-y-[5px] pl-[19px] marker:text-solai-accent-secondary">
          <li>Brush fallen leaves from the drain.</li>
          <li>Set the empty trays beneath the bench.</li>
          <li>Leave the path light facing down.</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="mb-0 mt-[20px]">At the harbour wall, the handrail is already cold. A low synth phrase comes through an upstairs window, almost lost beneath the ferry engine. I walk home by the water.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="min-w-0 border-l border-solai-border-subtle pl-[22px] [@media(max-width:650px)]:border-l-0 [@media(max-width:650px)]:border-t [@media(max-width:650px)]:pl-0 [@media(max-width:650px)]:pt-[22px]" aria-label="Field sketch and margin annotation">
        <figure class="m-0">
          <div class="rounded-[2px] border border-solai-border-subtle bg-solai-surface-panel px-[12px] py-[16px]">
            <svg class="mx-auto block h-auto w-full max-w-[230px]" viewBox="0 0 220 255" role="img" aria-labelledby="notebook-sketch-title notebook-sketch-description">
              <title id="notebook-sketch-title">Bean cutting, glasshouse bed 04</title>
              <desc id="notebook-sketch-description">An original line drawing of a slender stem with three broad leaves above the soil and branching roots below. A dotted line marks the soil surface.</desc>
