              <text x="28" y="177" fill="var(--secondary)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10">soil</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="mt-[10px] font-mono text-[11px] leading-[1.8] text-solai-text-secondary">Fig. 01 · Bed 04, leaf study.<br />Drawn at dusk; not to scale.</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="mt-[24px] border-t border-solai-border-subtle pt-[16px]">
          <h5 class="mb-[8px] mt-0 font-mono text-[11px] font-normal text-solai-accent-secondary">IN THE MARGIN</h5>
          <p class="m-0 text-[12px] leading-[1.9] text-solai-text-secondary">The lowest leaf leans towards the west vent. Check it again on the next evening round, before moving the tray.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-[28px] border-t border-solai-border-subtle pt-[16px]">
      <p id="notebook-note-1" class="m-0 max-w-[75ch] text-[11px] leading-[1.9] text-solai-text-secondary"><span class="mr-[7px] font-mono text-solai-accent-secondary">1.</span>Checked by hand beneath the dry top layer, beside the tray label. This entry records an observation, not a watering schedule. <a class="whitespace-nowrap text-solai-accent-primary underline decoration-solai-accent-primary underline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-solai-accent-primary" href="#notebook-ref-1" aria-label="Return to field note 1 reference">Back to entry ↑</a></p>
    </footer>
